{%- comment -%}
  收听栏目的一套节目，版式参照官方播客页：一张卡片，左栏是节目介绍、下载与导入说明，
  右栏是播放器、搜索与分集表（最新一集在上）。数据在 _data/listen/<slug>.yml
  （scripts/listen_import.py 生成分集，介绍等字段手写）；音频只在腾讯云镜像上（/media/listen/<slug>/，见 deploy/nginx）。
  没有脚本时，每一集都是指向镜像音频文件的普通链接；listen.js 在镜像上接管为页内播放，
  在 GitHub Pages 等其他主机上把分集改成镜像上同一集的链接，并说明去哪里收听。
  用法：{% include listen-series.liquid series='wealth-revolution' %}
{%- endcomment -%}
{% assign series = site.data.listen[include.series] %}
{% assign mirror = site.data.listen_hosts.mirror %}
{% assign media_base = mirror | append: '/media/listen/' | append: series.slug | append: '/' %}
{% assign total_seconds = 0 %}
{% for episode in series.episodes %}
  {% assign total_seconds = total_seconds | plus: episode.seconds %}
{% endfor %}
{% assign total_hours = total_seconds | divided_by: 3600 %}
{% assign total_minutes = total_seconds | modulo: 3600 | divided_by: 60 %}
{% assign official_label = series.official | remove: 'https://' | remove: 'www.' %}

<section
  class="listen-series"
  id="listen-{{ series.slug }}"
  data-listen-series="{{ series.slug }}"
  data-listen-mirror="{{ mirror }}"
  data-listen-page="{{ mirror }}{{ page.url }}"
  data-listen-title="{{ series.title | escape }}"
  data-listen-author="{{ series.author | escape }}"
  {% if series.cover %}
    data-listen-cover="{{ series.cover | relative_url }}"
  {% endif %}
  aria-labelledby="listen-{{ series.slug }}-title"
>
  <div class="listen-card">
    <aside class="listen-card__about">
      <h2 id="listen-{{ series.slug }}-title">{{ series.title }}</h2>
      {% if series.summary %}
        <p class="listen-card__summary">{{ series.summary }}</p>
      {% endif %}
      <p class="listen-card__meta">{{ series.author }} · 共 {{ series.episodes.size }} 集 · 约 {{ total_hours }} 小时 {{ total_minutes }} 分钟</p>

      {% if series.about %}
        <div class="listen-card__block">
          <p class="listen-card__label">关于这档节目</p>
          {% for paragraph in series.about %}
            <p>{{ paragraph }}</p>
          {% endfor %}
          {% if series.official != blank %}
            <p class="listen-card__source">
              介绍译自官方播客页
              <a href="{{ series.official }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{{ official_label }}</a>
            </p>
          {% endif %}
        </div>
      {% endif %}

      <div class="listen-card__block">
        <p class="listen-card__label">下载与导入 QQ 音乐</p>
        <p>
          每一集右边的 <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span> 下载单集；
          {%- if series.archive -%}
            也可以<a href="{{ mirror }}/media/listen/{{ series.archive }}"
              >下载全部 {{ series.episodes.size }} 集（zip，约 {{ series.archive_mb }} MB）</a
            >，解压后文件名就是「编号 + 标题」。
          {%- endif -%}
          每个文件都写好了标题（以三位编号开头）和歌手「{{ series.author }}」。
        </p>
        <details class="listen-guide">
          <summary>导入 QQ 音乐的步骤</summary>
          <ol>
            <li>
              把音频放进手机里一个单独的文件夹，例如 <code>Music/{{ series.title }}</code>；不要混进这个节目的旧文件。
            </li>
            <li>
              扫描前先<strong>关掉 Wi‑Fi 和移动数据</strong>。QQ
              音乐会按声音指纹做云匹配，可能把某一集识别成别人上传的版本，改掉歌手、打乱顺序；扫描完再联网。
            </li>
            <li>打开 QQ 音乐：我的 → 本地歌曲（本地音乐）→ 右上角菜单 → 扫描歌曲，选择自定义扫描，只勾选这个文件夹。</li>
            <li>
              排序选「按歌曲名」，就是 000 → {{ series.episodes.last.n }} 的顺序；按歌手「{{ series.author }}」筛选后全选，添加到新建歌单「
              {{- series.title -}}
              」。
            </li>
            <li>想在其他设备上听：在歌单里多选 → 上传到云盘（有的版本叫「我的 → 微云音乐网盘 → 上传本地歌曲」），同一账号登录即可。</li>
          </ol>
          <p class="listen-guide__note">以上是安卓手机上的步骤，不同版本的 QQ 音乐入口名称略有差异。</p>
        </details>
      </div>

      <p class="listen-card__mirror">
        {{ series.author }}《{{ series.title }}》官方镜像站
        {%- if series.official != blank %}
          · 官方收听：<a href="{{ series.official }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{{ official_label }}</a>
        {%- endif %}
      </p>
    </aside>

    <div class="listen-card__main">
      <div class="listen-away" data-listen-away hidden>
        {% if series.cover %}<img src="{{ series.cover | relative_url }}" alt="" width="88" height="88">{% endif %}
        <div>
          <p class="listen-away__label">在官方镜像站收听</p>
          <p>音频在官方镜像站在线播放。点任意一集，会在官方镜像站打开这一集。</p>
          <p class="listen-away__links">
            <a class="listen-away__primary" href="{{ mirror }}{{ page.url }}">去官方镜像站收听</a>
            {%- if series.official != blank %}
              <a href="{{ series.official }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">去官方播客</a>
            {%- endif %}
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="listen-player" data-listen-player hidden>
        <div class="listen-player__now">
          {% if series.cover %}
            <img class="listen-player__cover" src="{{ series.cover | relative_url }}" alt="" width="128" height="128">
          {% endif %}
          <div class="listen-player__info">
            <p class="listen-player__label" data-listen-now-label>正在播放</p>
            <p class="listen-player__title" data-listen-now-title>从下面选一集开始</p>
            <p class="listen-player__sub">{{ series.title }} · {{ series.author }}</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="listen-player__progress">
          <input type="range" min="0" max="0" step="1" value="0" aria-label="播放进度" data-listen-seek>
          <span data-listen-elapsed>00:00</span>
          <span data-listen-duration>00:00</span>
        </div>
        <div class="listen-player__controls">
          <button type="button" class="listen-player__icon" data-listen-prev aria-label="上一集" title="上一集">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M6 5v14M19 5 9 12l10 7z" />
            </svg>
          </button>
          <button type="button" class="listen-player__icon" data-listen-back aria-label="后退 15 秒" title="后退 15 秒">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M4 12a8 8 0 1 0 2.4-5.7M4 4v4h4" /><text x="12" y="15.5">15</text>
            </svg>
          </button>
          <button type="button" class="listen-player__play" data-listen-toggle aria-label="播放">
            <svg class="listen-player__glyph-play" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M8 5v14l11-7z" />
            </svg>
            <svg class="listen-player__glyph-pause" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M8 5v14M16 5v14" />
            </svg>
          </button>
          <button type="button" class="listen-player__icon" data-listen-forward aria-label="前进 15 秒" title="前进 15 秒">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M20 12a8 8 0 1 1-2.4-5.7M20 4v4h-4" /><text x="12" y="15.5">15</text>
            </svg>
          </button>
          <button type="button" class="listen-player__icon" data-listen-next aria-label="下一集" title="下一集">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M18 5v14M5 5l10 7-10 7z" />
            </svg>
          </button>
          <span class="listen-player__right">
            <button type="button" class="listen-player__rate" data-listen-rate aria-label="播放速度 1 倍">1×</button>
            <label class="listen-player__volume">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
                <path d="M4 9v6h4l5 4V5L8 9zM16 9a4 4 0 0 1 0 6" />
              </svg>
              <input type="range" min="0" max="1" step="0.05" value="1" aria-label="音量" data-listen-volume>
            </label>
          </span>
        </div>
        <audio preload="none" data-listen-audio></audio>
      </div>

      <div class="listen-search" data-listen-filter-wrap hidden>
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
          <circle cx="11" cy="11" r="6" /><path d="m20 20-4.5-4.5" />
        </svg>
        <input type="search" placeholder="搜索标题，例如「杠杆」" aria-label="按标题搜索分集" autocomplete="off" data-listen-filter>
      </div>

      <div class="listen-table">
        <p class="listen-table__head" aria-hidden="true"><span>#</span><span>标题</span><span>时长</span><span></span></p>
        <ol class="listen-episodes" reversed>
          {% for episode in series.episodes reversed %}
            {% assign minutes = episode.seconds | divided_by: 60 | prepend: '0' | slice: -2, 2 %}
            {% assign seconds = episode.seconds | modulo: 60 | prepend: '0' | slice: -2, 2 %}
            <li data-listen-episode="{{ episode.n }}">
              <a
                class="listen-episode"
                href="{{ media_base }}{{ episode.n }}.m4a"
                data-listen-src="/media/listen/{{ series.slug }}/{{ episode.n }}.m4a"
              >
                <span class="listen-episode__n">{{ episode.n }}</span>
                <span class="listen-episode__title">{{ episode.title }}</span>
                <span class="listen-episode__time">{{ minutes }}:{{ seconds }}</span>
              </a>
              <a
                class="listen-episode__download"
                href="{{ media_base }}{{ episode.n }}.m4a?download=1"
                download="{{ episode.n }}{{ episode.title | escape }}.m4a"
                title="下载第 {{ episode.n }} 集"
                aria-label="下载第 {{ episode.n }} 集：{{ episode.title | escape }}"
                ><span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a
              >
            </li>
          {% endfor %}
        </ol>
        <p class="listen-empty" data-listen-empty hidden>没有标题包含这个词的分集。</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<script src="{{ '/assets/js/listen.js' | relative_url | bust_file_cache }}" defer></script>
